Every vendored or ported file carries a header naming its upstream project, the
upstream commit SHA it was taken from, and its license. The authoritative
mapping of upstream path -> commit SHA -> file SHA256 -> destination path ->
patch path -> reason lives in docs/vendoring-map.md (hermes-agent) and
docs/omc-porting-map.md (oh-my-claudecode). Modifications to vendored files are
tracked as committed diffs under core/snowpea_core/vendor/patches/ and verified
in CI by scripts/verify_vendor_integrity.py.
